"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le02ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le02ob03re2img08.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le02ob03re2img08.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Are you interested in the Bolshoi Theater?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, it's a grand old building! <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: My grandmother came here every day. Come and look inside!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Really?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: My grandmother watched rehearsals. She practiced in the balcony. No one noticed a small quiet girl.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Uh huh.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le02ob03re2img08.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: One day the beautiful prima ballerina, Natalia Dudiniska, called her to the stage.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're kidding!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: She watched my grandmother dance. She checked her feet and posture.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: She did!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Then she took grandmother to the ballet master. He gave her small pink leather slippers. She began rehearsing the next day.<br />", "id": 2, "time": "18500", "image": "engenn5le02ob03re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Amazing! <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Here is a photo of my grandmother, Olga Petrova, dancing in Swan Lake!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Unbelievable!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Come to the theater tonight. Watch my daughter dance Coppelia.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'd love to!", "id": 3, "time": "40500", "image": "engenn5le02ob03re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le02ob03re5aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le02ob03re5img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally in Russia"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Mother Russia"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Famous Structures > The Kremlin"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Order of Adjectives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you use two or more adjectives, the order of the adjectives is important."}, {"type": "example", "content": "She wore an expensive red cotton dress to the party. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The ballerina wore a soft pink silk costume."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The following is the order of adjectives you need to keep in mind when describing something or someone:  <br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">general opinion</span>, <span class=\"strong\">specific opinion</span>, <span class=\"strong\">size</span>, <span class=\"strong\">shape</span>, <span class=\"strong\">age</span>, <span class=\"strong\">color</span>, <span class=\"strong\">nationality</span>, <span class=\"strong\">material</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Adjective order </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Example </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"opinion \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tattered \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shape \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"square \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"age \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"old \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"color \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"brown \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nationality \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Chinese \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"material\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lacquer\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Reacting to and Commenting on Stories "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you react to a story, you should let the storyteller know that you are interested."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Anne</span>:The bride ran out of the church and left the groom at the altar!<br /><span class =\"strong\">Tom</span>: I don't believe it!"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you react, you can say things like:<br /> <br /> Really?<br />  She did?<br />  You're kidding!<br /> Amazing!<br /> Unbelievable!<br /> I don't believe it!<br /> No!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "grand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "attractive in style and appearance  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Bolshoi Theater is a grand old building. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear at the ballet."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "column "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a tall support for a building   "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Bolshoi Theater has a row of columns in front. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ballerina "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a woman who dances in the ballet  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The ballerina danced in Swan Lake. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "balcony "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area of seats in the upper level of a theater  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She stood in the balcony and watched the dancers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "posture "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the way you hold your body  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ballerinas have very good posture."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "slipper "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a thin indoor shoe "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He gave her pink ballet slippers to wear. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rehearsal "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a time to practice "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The rehearsal for the ballet lasted several hours. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to rehearse "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to practice again and again "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Dancers rehearse for many hours a day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le02ob03aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le02ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write 7 - 9 sentences about something you are interested in and you want to get better at, like a sport, dance or musical instrument."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say if it is difficult to learn."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain how you do it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say how often you practice doing it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write 40 to 50 words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about something I practice doing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my sentences aloud."}]}], "type": "sena"}